### Pareto Front Assessment:

The non-dominated candidates (no other point beats both objectives simultaneously):
1. **`16p5-0add-19deg-175s-N2-1450s`**: E≈437.9, PF≈0.394 — highest modulus but only 3 runs, high variability (SD=102 bar), 1 discard in run1, run3 has high CV=0.227. The mean across runs 1,2,3: ~(437.9+196.9+291.7)/3 ≈ 309 bar modulus, PF ~(0.394+0.505+0.415)/3 ≈ 0.438. Highly variable.
