3. **`17-0add-15deg-30s-N2-1200s`** (runs 1-7): Mean E ≈ (216+248+209+164+324+330+305)/7 ≈ 257 bar, Mean PF ≈ (0.507+0.494+0.523+0.589+0.384+0.390+0.416)/7 ≈ 0.472. Reasonable balance.

