- `16p5-0add-19deg-175s-N2-1450s`: 3 independent runs exist. Run1: E=437.9±102, PF=0.394; Run2: E=196.9±10, PF=0.505; Run3: E=291.7±44, PF=0.415. Enormous run-to-run variability — not confirmed as a stable high-modulus candidate.
